Hi <%= @recipient&.user_name || @recipient&.email %>,

Wine package #<%= @package&.id %> from <%= @producer&.name || "Unknown producer" %> still has <%= @pending_count %> review(s) pending.

The review deadline is <%= @deadline %><% if @days_until_deadline %> — <%= @days_until_deadline.zero? ? "today" : "in #{@days_until_deadline} #{'day'.pluralize(@days_until_deadline)}" %><% end %>.

<% if @pending_items.any? -%>
Still waiting on:
<% @pending_items.each do |item| -%>
* <%= item.label %><% if item.quantity.to_i > 1 %> (x<%= item.quantity %>)<% end %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
Open the wine package: <%= @package_url %>

<%= @notification.message %>